# Spec 037, ProceduresAbi_MissingSymbol: @SCENE_NAME@. A module that lacks an entry point, named by absolute path.
Option "searchpath" "display" ["@OR_DISPLAY_PATH@"]
Format 8 8 1
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Projection "orthographic"

Display "missing.tif" "file" "rgba"
WorldBegin
@PROC_BODY@
WorldEnd
